WEBVTT

01:40.530 --> 01:44.210
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.100 --> 01:47.220
[Episode 31]

01:49.000 --> 01:49.950
Watch your step.

01:54.590 --> 01:55.920
In the Fragrant Grove,

01:56.280 --> 01:57.560
there's a friend of mine

01:58.229 --> 02:00.000
who specializes in spatial barrier techniques.

02:00.560 --> 02:01.640
We can take shelter at her place

02:01.640 --> 02:02.430
for a while.

02:08.310 --> 02:09.120
Stop hiding.

02:09.750 --> 02:10.560
Come out now.

02:15.190 --> 02:16.430
If you don't,

02:16.750 --> 02:17.750
I'll tear your place

02:17.750 --> 02:18.710
down.

02:26.710 --> 02:29.270
[Youhu Clan, Curly]

02:37.190 --> 02:39.400
Yuanzhong, what brings you here?

02:40.800 --> 02:41.710
We came as guests,

02:42.030 --> 02:43.360
and yet you don't even offer us tea?

03:05.960 --> 03:06.750
Tanyin,

03:07.680 --> 03:09.030
this is my childhood friend.

03:11.470 --> 03:12.590
Just an acquaintance.

03:13.240 --> 03:14.520
You can call her Curly.

03:14.920 --> 03:16.079
She was born with curly fur.

03:16.400 --> 03:17.240
When she was little,

03:17.870 --> 03:19.150
she once stole Dingxu's Heaven-Turning Seal

03:19.590 --> 03:21.280
just to straighten her fur

03:21.480 --> 03:22.950
and almost got crushed to death by it.

03:23.750 --> 03:25.150
I didn't steal it. I just borrowed it.

03:29.680 --> 03:30.470
Why did you laugh?

03:32.520 --> 03:33.870
I laughed because it was funny.

03:34.400 --> 03:35.280
Is laughing

03:35.360 --> 03:36.960
not allowed here?

03:39.710 --> 03:41.560
After that, she caused some trouble

03:42.360 --> 03:43.870
and couldn't stay in the clan anymore.

03:44.310 --> 03:45.840
I gave her the Fragrant Grove

03:45.960 --> 03:47.470
so she'd have a place to live.

03:48.079 --> 03:49.120
She once told me

03:49.710 --> 03:50.840
she owed me a favor.

03:51.560 --> 03:52.710
She promised to repay me no matter what,

03:53.000 --> 03:54.030
even if it meant going through

03:54.280 --> 03:55.400
extreme challenges.

03:56.190 --> 03:57.000
Now,

03:57.630 --> 03:59.190
it's time for her to make good on that promise.

03:59.960 --> 04:00.680
So that's why

04:00.680 --> 04:01.750
you asked me to bring you here?

04:03.590 --> 04:04.590
Curly's other spells

04:04.590 --> 04:05.590
are mediocre at best,

04:06.000 --> 04:07.710
but when it comes to spatial barrier techniques,

04:08.030 --> 04:09.310
she is exceptionally skilled.

04:09.590 --> 04:11.150
When she was a kid and got into trouble,

04:11.280 --> 04:12.840
she'd always hide,

04:13.150 --> 04:14.240
and no one could find her.

04:14.710 --> 04:15.960
She really had some skills.

04:16.250 --> 04:17.370
What does that mean?

04:18.310 --> 04:19.269
Are you here to take my life?

04:20.430 --> 04:21.680
Not to take your life.

04:22.270 --> 04:23.920
Just to stay for a few days.

04:23.920 --> 04:25.430
That's basically the same as taking my life!

04:26.000 --> 04:27.040
This place is so cramped,

04:27.040 --> 04:28.040
with three people living here,

04:28.040 --> 04:29.560
constantly bumping into each other.

04:29.600 --> 04:30.840
How could we possibly live like that?

04:31.190 --> 04:32.000
What?

04:33.430 --> 04:34.560
We can't stay?

04:34.800 --> 04:35.470
No.

04:40.190 --> 04:42.480
I can tell you're hurt,

04:42.480 --> 04:44.120
so you must be going through something.

04:44.250 --> 04:45.370
But you're more than

04:45.480 --> 04:47.310
capable of

04:47.430 --> 04:48.750
finding a safe spot.

04:48.800 --> 04:49.600
Why must you...

04:49.980 --> 04:52.610
Why must you put someone else in a tough spot?

04:52.750 --> 04:53.560
Right?

04:53.720 --> 04:54.830
Since I'm here,

04:55.390 --> 04:56.920
I have my reasons.

04:57.000 --> 04:58.190
I don't care about your reasons!

04:58.190 --> 04:59.600
You simply can't stay here.

04:59.600 --> 05:01.160
What about the favor you owe me?

05:01.310 --> 05:02.310
I'd go through

05:02.310 --> 05:03.600
any extreme task for you,

05:03.600 --> 05:05.240
but you can't stay here!

05:05.750 --> 05:06.920
You know me.

05:06.980 --> 05:08.370
I just can't tolerate it.

05:13.720 --> 05:14.510
Alright.

05:15.870 --> 05:17.120
Then we have no choice

05:17.720 --> 05:19.510
but to return to Fangwai Mountain.

05:22.390 --> 05:23.190
Oh, by the way,

05:23.310 --> 05:24.510
your three elder sisters

05:24.800 --> 05:26.070
miss you very much,

05:26.240 --> 05:27.430
especially your second sister.

05:27.630 --> 05:28.870
She's been longing to see you.

05:29.240 --> 05:30.070
Your second sister

05:30.270 --> 05:31.870
is really blessed.

05:32.270 --> 05:34.630
She has a happy marriage and a flourishing family.

05:35.000 --> 05:36.310
She now has eight children.

05:36.720 --> 05:38.870
The youngest still hasn't mastered transformation.

05:39.120 --> 05:40.800
If they find out you're here

05:40.920 --> 05:42.360
and all come to visit,

05:42.570 --> 05:43.770
the Fragrant Grove

05:44.430 --> 05:45.510
will be bustling.

05:48.510 --> 05:49.310
Wait!

05:52.830 --> 05:54.159
If you want to stay here,

05:54.159 --> 05:55.720
you'll have to follow my rules.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.270
You're just temporary guests here,

05:57.270 --> 05:58.560
not the owners.

05:58.680 --> 05:59.680
You'll have to take care of

05:59.680 --> 06:00.830
your own food, clothes, shelter, and transport.

06:00.830 --> 06:02.040
Don't expect me to serve you.

06:02.430 --> 06:04.240
I'm not in the habit of waiting on anyone.

06:05.120 --> 06:05.920
Oh, by the way,

06:05.950 --> 06:07.360
you're Yuanzhong's servant girl, right?

06:07.800 --> 06:08.920
Take good care of him

06:08.980 --> 06:10.740
and make sure he leaves as soon as possible.

06:11.160 --> 06:12.720
Is this your kitchen?

06:13.750 --> 06:14.560
Yes.

06:16.480 --> 06:17.560
It's very clean.

06:20.680 --> 06:22.270
Even the stove is spotless.

06:23.480 --> 06:25.120
Do you never cook with fire?

06:25.740 --> 06:27.300
Lighting a fire to cook is too troublesome,

06:27.480 --> 06:29.190
and the dust is hard to clean.

06:29.360 --> 06:31.000
I always eat fresh fruits

06:31.000 --> 06:31.920
and raw food.

06:32.390 --> 06:33.750
We prefer cooked food

06:33.920 --> 06:34.720
and hot meals.

06:41.310 --> 06:42.560
These are all medicinal herbs.

06:42.920 --> 06:43.800
There's so much of it.

06:44.190 --> 06:45.000
Really?

06:46.430 --> 06:48.310
I thought it was just some wild greens.

06:48.480 --> 06:50.120
I gathered them from the forest.

06:50.120 --> 06:51.310
They taste awful.

06:51.310 --> 06:52.120
Extremely bitter.

06:53.920 --> 06:54.950
Yuanzhong is seriously injured;

06:54.980 --> 06:56.190
he needs medicine to recover.

06:56.560 --> 06:57.270
Do you have any tools

06:57.270 --> 06:58.680
for decocting herbs?

06:59.010 --> 07:00.040
I wasn't done speaking yet.

07:00.190 --> 07:00.950
Well,

07:00.950 --> 07:02.830
the two rooms on the east side are for you.

07:03.000 --> 07:04.920
That loft is my bedroom.

07:05.160 --> 07:06.310
I usually

07:06.310 --> 07:07.830
eat, rest,

07:07.830 --> 07:10.070
read, train, and meditate there.

07:10.430 --> 07:11.870
All of that is important to me.

07:12.510 --> 07:14.390
If you have nothing urgent, don't disturb me.

07:14.830 --> 07:16.950
Even if you do, it's best not to.

07:17.360 --> 07:18.070
So, if we

07:18.070 --> 07:19.120
ever need to find you,

07:19.120 --> 07:20.160
what should we do?

07:20.160 --> 07:21.160
Write a letter.

07:22.270 --> 07:23.070
See that mailbox

07:23.070 --> 07:24.680
in the courtyard?

07:24.870 --> 07:26.000
If you need something,

07:26.000 --> 07:27.560
just put a letter in there.

07:27.560 --> 07:29.000
I'll check it once a day at 7 p.m.

07:29.040 --> 07:30.040
If I need anything,

07:30.040 --> 07:31.720
I'll contact you the same way.

07:32.800 --> 07:35.070
Looks like you won't be leaving

07:35.070 --> 07:36.920
in just a few days, huh?

07:37.310 --> 07:38.870
Then let's set some rules now.

07:39.070 --> 07:40.340
No one disturbs anyone,

07:40.480 --> 07:41.510
and we each keep to ourselves.

07:41.600 --> 07:42.510
Sounds good?

07:50.540 --> 07:52.060
I wasn't finished talking.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.070
Let me tell you about

07:55.070 --> 07:56.800
my daily routine.

07:57.190 --> 07:58.750
As long as we avoid

07:58.870 --> 08:00.390
using the same space

08:00.390 --> 08:01.390
for the same things

08:01.390 --> 08:02.510
at the same time,

08:02.510 --> 08:03.560
we won't run into each other

08:03.560 --> 08:05.270
or cause any trouble.

08:05.560 --> 08:07.600
I usually wake up at 9 a.m.,

08:07.600 --> 08:08.630
wash up at 10:15 a.m.,

08:08.630 --> 08:09.680
eat at 10:45 a.m.,

08:09.680 --> 08:10.950
and train at noon.

08:11.040 --> 08:11.870
Are you done yet?

08:11.870 --> 08:12.480
Not yet.

08:12.480 --> 08:13.430
That was just the fifth rule.

08:13.430 --> 08:14.560
There's still the sixth.

08:14.560 --> 08:16.230
This place originally belonged to Yuanzhong, didn't it?

08:16.820 --> 08:17.620
Yes.

08:19.390 --> 08:20.750
But now I live here,

08:20.750 --> 08:21.950
so it's mine.

08:24.000 --> 08:25.920
We had no choice but to come here,

08:26.120 --> 08:27.270
but we won't stay long.

08:27.600 --> 08:28.750
I'll do my best

08:28.750 --> 08:30.000
to follow your rules,

08:30.160 --> 08:31.310
but if I can't,

08:31.330 --> 08:32.539
I hope you can be understanding.

08:34.600 --> 08:35.720
I haven't finished it yet!

08:36.030 --> 08:36.840
Write it down.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.929
I haven't mentioned the sixth rule yet.

08:51.480 --> 08:53.030
Curly isn't a bad person.

08:53.750 --> 08:55.390
She's just a little reclusive.

08:56.000 --> 08:56.870
It's not a big deal.

08:58.960 --> 09:00.790
Are you still bothered by what happened in Yandu?

09:02.840 --> 09:03.840
I'm not upset.

09:04.600 --> 09:05.670
I just don't get it.

09:06.320 --> 09:07.120
Don't get it?

09:08.870 --> 09:10.120
You're not a villain,

09:10.630 --> 09:12.270
and you haven't hurt anyone.

09:12.600 --> 09:13.320
Why did they

09:13.320 --> 09:14.360
treat you like that?

09:15.120 --> 09:16.230
Humans are treacherous,

09:17.120 --> 09:18.150
and easily swayed by the crowd.

09:18.630 --> 09:20.630
And when divine forces

09:20.630 --> 09:21.720
come into play,

09:22.080 --> 09:25.120
their choices seem inevitable.

09:33.320 --> 09:34.960
This shouldn't have happened.

09:37.440 --> 09:38.510
You're too clever

09:39.200 --> 09:40.440
to not understand this.

09:41.030 --> 09:42.120
You just feel that...

09:42.240 --> 09:43.550
I feel sorry for you.

09:43.670 --> 09:45.200
I feel that you are treated unfairly.

09:45.840 --> 09:47.150
Leaving aside the War Demons,

09:47.150 --> 09:48.720
at the very least, the humans and the Youhu Clan

09:48.720 --> 09:50.390
should've been grateful to you.

09:50.840 --> 09:52.270
They should have remembered your kindness.

09:52.630 --> 09:54.270
It shouldn't have turned out this way.

10:04.550 --> 10:05.750
Throughout this long journey of escape,

10:06.480 --> 10:07.440
you've endured so much.

10:08.030 --> 10:09.870
You've mentioned it countless times already.

10:10.000 --> 10:11.000
I must say it again.

10:12.030 --> 10:14.120
No matter how many times I say it, it's never enough.

10:15.030 --> 10:16.150
Actually, over the past few days,

10:16.960 --> 10:18.630
I wasn't entirely unconscious.

10:19.120 --> 10:21.120
I woke up a few times,

10:21.120 --> 10:22.240
feeling disoriented and confused.

10:23.720 --> 10:24.720
Each time I woke up,

10:25.440 --> 10:26.960
I could hear your voice.

10:27.510 --> 10:28.480
I thought to myself,

10:29.600 --> 10:32.600
heaven hasn't been too harsh with me.

10:33.790 --> 10:35.280
At least I met you.

10:40.750 --> 10:41.670
There's something

10:41.670 --> 10:42.840
I haven't told you.

10:43.510 --> 10:44.320
Actually, back then,

10:44.320 --> 10:45.840
what you saw in my sea of consciousness

10:46.840 --> 10:48.030
wasn't the whole picture.

10:48.710 --> 10:49.950
They call me the demon,

10:51.360 --> 10:52.320
and that's not entirely untrue.

10:53.390 --> 10:54.910
During the forty years I was locked away,

10:55.740 --> 10:57.510
I had a thought.

10:58.410 --> 11:01.290
I believed the world was full of sin,

11:01.910 --> 11:03.030
that human nature was inherently evil.

11:03.630 --> 11:04.600
Always hungry, seeking to be filled;

11:05.040 --> 11:06.070
when cold, yearning for warmth;

11:06.600 --> 11:08.630
when warm, craving pride, luxury, and indulgence;

11:08.910 --> 11:10.000
always desiring more.

11:10.960 --> 11:11.750
So,

11:12.510 --> 11:14.320
I wanted to use the Divine Left Hand as a sacrifice

11:14.840 --> 11:16.670
to pass judgment on all the sins in this world.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.670
Those who bore the Five Sins

11:19.270 --> 11:21.720
would be consumed by Heavenly Fire.

11:23.200 --> 11:26.390
I believed that, given how corrupt the world was,

11:27.320 --> 11:28.440
once the judgment was made,

11:29.490 --> 11:31.260
everything would be purified and transformed into a clear, bright place.

11:32.750 --> 11:34.550
From the moment I was freed,

11:35.360 --> 11:37.200
I was resolute in carrying out this plan.

11:38.440 --> 11:40.360
I thought, since the world had wronged me,

11:41.630 --> 11:43.150
I would repay its evil with vengeance on all.

11:45.030 --> 11:45.840
But,

11:46.630 --> 11:48.200
fate had me meet you.

11:50.510 --> 11:51.320
Ji Tanyin,

11:53.440 --> 11:54.720
you have always treated me with genuine sincerity,

11:55.550 --> 11:56.590
never pretending,

11:58.040 --> 11:59.680
and saving me from danger over and over again.

12:00.390 --> 12:01.790
At first, I doubted you.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.440
I couldn't believe someone like you

12:04.670 --> 12:06.240
could exist in this world.

12:06.910 --> 12:08.360
And I couldn't believe that heaven

12:09.790 --> 12:11.750
would show any favor to someone like me.

12:14.510 --> 12:15.360
But gradually,

12:17.000 --> 12:18.240
I started to like you.

12:20.000 --> 12:21.360
My heart became attached,

12:22.150 --> 12:23.150
and I felt a sense of longing.

12:24.750 --> 12:25.550
I was afraid,

12:26.910 --> 12:28.220
afraid that I might falter.

12:29.230 --> 12:31.200
So, when we were at Orange Lake and Yandu,

12:32.110 --> 12:33.120
I pushed you away

12:34.660 --> 12:36.420
because I was afraid that, because of you,

12:37.320 --> 12:38.840
I would lose myself.

12:48.910 --> 12:50.030
In the battle at Yandu,

12:51.390 --> 12:52.960
even though the whole world criticized me,

12:53.440 --> 12:54.560
even though I was cornered,

12:55.670 --> 12:57.030
I never regretted it.

12:58.080 --> 12:59.000
When you gain something,

12:59.790 --> 13:01.030
you will inevitably lose something.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.960
I gained the Divine Left Hand,

13:05.000 --> 13:05.750
and with it, the power

13:05.750 --> 13:07.320
to rival the gods.

13:07.670 --> 13:08.870
So naturally,

13:08.870 --> 13:11.150
I lost the simple life of an ordinary person.

13:13.080 --> 13:14.270
And I gained you,

13:14.870 --> 13:16.230
so whatever else I lose,

13:17.870 --> 13:19.320
I wouldn't care.

13:21.790 --> 13:23.240
They say the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

13:23.960 --> 13:25.150
guides all living beings,

13:26.390 --> 13:29.150
neither a god nor a deity, yet greater than one.

13:30.910 --> 13:31.720
Ji Tanyin,

13:34.150 --> 13:35.550
you truly transformed me.

13:36.510 --> 13:37.790
You saved the world

13:39.550 --> 13:40.550
and me.

13:59.840 --> 14:00.630
Yuanzhong,

14:03.960 --> 14:05.960
there's something I...

14:11.790 --> 14:13.630
I, actually...

14:16.510 --> 14:17.320
What happened?

14:25.030 --> 14:26.720
I was hurt by Master Yan before,

14:27.670 --> 14:28.750
sustaining some internal injuries.

14:29.870 --> 14:30.910
It's nothing serious.

14:34.740 --> 14:35.700
Glad to hear that.

14:37.270 --> 14:38.270
Glad to hear that.

14:43.320 --> 14:44.240
Sorry.

14:47.000 --> 14:48.200
Why are you apologizing?

14:52.630 --> 14:53.910
Sorry, Yuanzhong.

14:54.910 --> 14:56.240
Sorry, Yuanzhong.

15:20.720 --> 15:22.120
You're worried about the High Priest.

15:25.960 --> 15:27.000
Right now, everyone in the world

15:27.000 --> 15:28.120
is searching for Yuanzhong.

15:29.550 --> 15:31.390
Whether the past events were true or not,

15:32.200 --> 15:33.120
his Divine Left Hand

15:33.120 --> 15:34.790
truly has the power to destroy the entire world.

15:34.910 --> 15:35.840
You're afraid now.

15:38.600 --> 15:39.550
Back then, Yuanzhong punched

15:39.550 --> 15:40.720
through Pinghu.

15:41.320 --> 15:42.550
They tried every possible method

15:42.550 --> 15:43.510
to seal him.

15:44.140 --> 15:45.240
Now that they know he has the ability

15:45.240 --> 15:46.550
to destroy the entire world,

15:47.320 --> 15:49.120
they'd want to bring him down even more.

15:50.120 --> 15:51.790
Now that you're the Lord of Yandu City,

15:52.000 --> 15:52.720
with such an identity,

15:52.720 --> 15:54.200
it's really inappropriate for you to be here.

15:55.960 --> 15:57.000
That's exactly

15:57.120 --> 15:58.390
why I should come.

15:58.840 --> 15:59.870
Not because of you.

16:01.080 --> 16:02.960
The High Priest isn't a bad person.

16:03.200 --> 16:04.000
We can't just try to

16:04.000 --> 16:05.270
eliminate someone

16:05.350 --> 16:07.320
because they have power and we're afraid.

16:07.550 --> 16:08.960
If that's the case,

16:09.080 --> 16:09.960
then there would be too many people in this world

16:09.960 --> 16:11.840
who deserve to be killed.

16:17.870 --> 16:18.720
What are you talking about?

16:20.030 --> 16:20.910
It doesn't concern you.

16:22.680 --> 16:24.370
Then let's talk about something that does concern me.

16:24.750 --> 16:25.870
I've brought back the food.

16:26.080 --> 16:27.960
It's your turn to take care of the rest.

16:28.440 --> 16:29.270
The river is over there.

16:29.360 --> 16:30.240
Go take care of it.

16:34.270 --> 16:34.870
I'll go.

16:36.160 --> 16:36.950
Let him go.

16:42.910 --> 16:43.750
I'll go with you.

16:49.440 --> 16:51.150
Fu Jiuyun said Taihe is a demon.

16:51.870 --> 16:52.750
What exactly happened during the war between gods and demons?

16:52.750 --> 16:54.150
Why did Hannv stop me

16:55.080 --> 16:56.200
from meeting the gods

16:56.200 --> 16:57.550
from Thunder Division?

16:58.630 --> 17:00.270
Did she know something?

17:01.550 --> 17:02.630
I don't know why, but the Ascension Platform

17:02.630 --> 17:03.670
can't be opened.

17:04.440 --> 17:05.480
I need to think of another way

17:05.480 --> 17:06.550
to return to the Divine Realm.

17:07.510 --> 17:09.030
But I've lost my divine bone.

17:09.880 --> 17:11.200
What should I do?

17:16.550 --> 17:17.349
How are you?

17:18.640 --> 17:19.440
Are you alright?

17:20.240 --> 17:22.200
I'm fine, don't worry about me.

17:27.270 --> 17:29.160
Your eyes will definitely heal.

17:31.030 --> 17:31.830
I know.

17:34.890 --> 17:35.890
Are you trying to drink some water?

17:38.400 --> 17:39.510
I'm thinking of going for a walk.

17:39.960 --> 17:41.110
I'll come with you.

17:41.720 --> 17:42.480
Alright.

17:42.480 --> 17:43.110
Come on.

17:48.920 --> 17:49.750
Be careful.

17:50.750 --> 17:51.720
Watch the steps.

17:56.680 --> 17:58.750
There's a water wheel on the right ahead,

17:58.960 --> 18:00.000
do you remember?

18:03.070 --> 18:03.880
There's a beautiful little garden ahead

18:03.880 --> 18:05.680
on the left.

18:06.270 --> 18:08.030
There's even a swing inside.

18:09.180 --> 18:11.980
♫Too many old dreams♫

18:09.720 --> 18:10.680
What are you laughing at?

18:12.400 --> 18:13.200
Nothing.

18:12.420 --> 18:15.440
♫Where did the snow fall to?♫

18:16.030 --> 18:17.070
Why do I feel

18:16.220 --> 18:20.060
♫Going to face a catastrophe♫

18:17.440 --> 18:19.000
you're laughing with a smug expression?

18:19.590 --> 18:20.400
Well,

18:20.450 --> 18:23.280
♫No one is irrelevant♫

18:21.550 --> 18:23.240
I suddenly remembered when we were at Fangwai Mountain.

18:23.920 --> 18:24.750
Back then,

18:25.510 --> 18:26.510
someone was

18:26.510 --> 18:27.640
so clumsy

18:26.870 --> 18:29.540
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

18:28.240 --> 18:29.830
and not as careful as now.

18:29.800 --> 18:33.290
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

18:30.750 --> 18:32.030
Who is "someone?"

18:32.200 --> 18:33.110
Just name me directly.

18:33.110 --> 18:34.350
It's fine to say it's me.

18:34.150 --> 18:37.970
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

18:34.350 --> 18:35.480
How can I do that?

18:36.000 --> 18:37.440
After all, I'm blind now,

18:37.720 --> 18:39.030
and still need your care.

18:38.000 --> 18:41.030
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

18:39.240 --> 18:40.550
What if I upset you

18:40.720 --> 18:41.550
and you ignore me?

18:42.000 --> 18:42.830
What should I do then?

18:42.300 --> 18:44.300
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

18:44.470 --> 18:46.470
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

18:46.620 --> 18:50.400
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

18:47.680 --> 18:49.960
Let's go for a walk.

18:50.510 --> 18:51.310
Go out?

18:50.730 --> 18:52.730
♫If between oaths♫

18:53.000 --> 18:54.810
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

18:53.030 --> 18:53.960
It's fine.

18:54.350 --> 18:55.720
At night, the Fragrant Grove is shrouded in mist,

18:55.060 --> 18:58.630
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

18:55.920 --> 18:57.400
which acts as a natural protective barrier.

18:57.510 --> 18:58.750
Even if we go out now,

18:58.920 --> 19:00.510
it won't be so easy to be discovered.

18:59.300 --> 19:01.690
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

19:01.720 --> 19:03.990
♫Longing fades in half♫

19:02.920 --> 19:04.310
Then let's go early and come back early.

19:04.010 --> 19:08.190
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

19:08.720 --> 19:15.760
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

19:17.070 --> 19:19.300
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

19:19.330 --> 19:21.390
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

19:21.590 --> 19:25.340
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

19:23.310 --> 19:24.110
What's wrong?

19:25.680 --> 19:27.850
♫The moon falls by the riverbank♫

19:26.200 --> 19:27.480
There's a tree ahead,

19:27.870 --> 19:30.020
♫The light finally dims♫

19:28.430 --> 19:29.710
a big pear tree.

19:30.040 --> 19:34.030
♫How can my heart be at ease?♫

19:31.550 --> 19:33.160
I feel like I've seen it somewhere before.

19:34.340 --> 19:36.740
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

19:36.760 --> 19:38.760
♫Longing fades in half♫

19:38.810 --> 19:43.260
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

19:43.570 --> 19:53.470
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

19:46.680 --> 19:47.480
Come on.

19:57.030 --> 19:58.270
This place is so beautiful.

19:58.790 --> 20:00.270
No wonder Curly likes it.

20:02.750 --> 20:03.790
Do you like it too?

20:05.550 --> 20:06.350
I do.

20:06.540 --> 20:09.230
Then let's live here too,

20:09.310 --> 20:10.110
how about it?

20:11.720 --> 20:13.790
But Curly will be so angry.

20:16.790 --> 20:17.590
Then we'll

20:18.320 --> 20:20.360
find an even more beautiful place,

20:20.790 --> 20:22.160
build a house,

20:22.720 --> 20:23.680
plant a tree,

20:24.440 --> 20:25.480
dig a pond,

20:26.480 --> 20:27.550
and raise some fish.

20:28.160 --> 20:29.110
Xue and I

20:29.110 --> 20:30.510
can cook,

20:31.220 --> 20:32.220
so we'll take care of you.

20:32.680 --> 20:33.480
As for you,

20:34.010 --> 20:35.010
when you're free,

20:35.070 --> 20:36.750
you can do some carpentry work,

20:37.680 --> 20:39.400
sell it at the nearby market,

20:40.000 --> 20:41.110
and make some money.

20:42.550 --> 20:43.640
How about

20:44.220 --> 20:45.940
we live a simple and peaceful life

20:46.480 --> 20:47.270
like that,

20:53.430 --> 20:54.230
Tanyin?

20:58.550 --> 21:00.070
You say you can cook,

21:00.960 --> 21:02.030
but I don't believe it.

21:02.350 --> 21:03.240
I really can.

21:03.830 --> 21:05.000
I studied it seriously.

21:09.680 --> 21:11.640
This place is quite far from Fangwai Mountain.

21:11.920 --> 21:12.590
How did you

21:12.590 --> 21:13.750
find this place?

21:15.160 --> 21:15.960
It wasn't me,

21:16.930 --> 21:18.280
it was my father who found it.

21:18.400 --> 21:19.310
Your father?

21:21.830 --> 21:22.960
Since the day I was born,

21:23.310 --> 21:24.550
the Youhu Clan and the War Demons

21:24.550 --> 21:25.590
have been in constant conflict.

21:26.680 --> 21:28.350
My father, worried that our clan would not prevail,

21:28.880 --> 21:30.270
found this place,

21:31.200 --> 21:32.470
believing that in times of danger,

21:32.960 --> 21:34.590
he could bring the clan here to seek refuge.

21:37.270 --> 21:38.720
This place is like a paradise,

21:39.400 --> 21:40.760
and the mist serves as a natural barrier.

21:41.270 --> 21:43.000
It truly is a perfect place to seek refuge.

21:44.000 --> 21:44.790
What about you?

21:45.960 --> 21:47.200
How did you grow up?

21:48.200 --> 21:49.350
Were your parents nice to you?

21:55.110 --> 21:55.920
Would you prefer not to talk about it?

21:59.070 --> 22:00.110
I was thinking,

22:01.110 --> 22:02.510
how should I put it?

22:05.960 --> 22:07.590
My mother's health was always poor,

22:08.550 --> 22:09.750
and she passed away when I was young.

22:10.510 --> 22:11.710
Since I was little,

22:12.200 --> 22:13.920
it was just my father who took care of me.

22:15.550 --> 22:17.480
But it's been

22:17.480 --> 22:19.160
so long now.

22:20.350 --> 22:22.000
His image in my memory

22:22.720 --> 22:24.000
has already become blurry.

22:25.440 --> 22:27.310
My father was an incredible craftsman,

22:28.590 --> 22:29.960
and he had very high expectations for me.

22:31.200 --> 22:32.590
If I made a mistake,

22:32.750 --> 22:33.960
I'd get a slap on the hand.

22:34.640 --> 22:36.000
But even when I did things right,

22:36.350 --> 22:37.680
he would always complain,

22:38.350 --> 22:39.640
saying, "If only

22:40.000 --> 22:41.200
you were a boy."

22:43.160 --> 22:44.270
It felt like

22:44.920 --> 22:46.440
no matter what I did,

22:46.640 --> 22:47.880
no matter how hard I tried,

22:48.870 --> 22:50.220
he was never satisfied.

22:52.720 --> 22:54.960
Then later, I went up the mountain

22:55.110 --> 22:56.720
and began learning the craft from my master.

22:58.240 --> 22:59.550
When I really think about it,

23:00.160 --> 23:01.310
the time I spent with my father,

23:01.310 --> 23:02.510
as his daughter,

23:03.640 --> 23:04.960
was actually quite limited.

23:05.480 --> 23:08.400
Maybe it's because your craftsmanship is so remarkable

23:08.720 --> 23:09.510
that

23:09.830 --> 23:11.510
he's so strict with you.

23:12.590 --> 23:14.190
Shouldn't he praise me for that?

23:15.750 --> 23:17.030
Most humans

23:17.030 --> 23:18.750
tend to favor sons over daughters,

23:19.590 --> 23:21.110
always hoping for a son

23:21.400 --> 23:22.640
to take over the family business.

23:23.750 --> 23:25.110
Is that the case with the Youhu Clan?

23:27.160 --> 23:28.110
It's a bit better here.

23:29.550 --> 23:31.400
What's wrong with having a daughter?

23:31.510 --> 23:32.960
Well, you've asked the wrong person.

23:33.720 --> 23:35.310
I can't say anything positive about it.

23:37.790 --> 23:39.240
Don't tell me you share that view.

23:39.240 --> 23:41.160
I don't favor sons over daughters.

23:43.110 --> 23:44.680
It's just some personal grudges.

23:45.550 --> 23:46.680
Personal grudges?

23:48.720 --> 23:49.790
I have an elder sister.

23:50.830 --> 23:52.110
She's mischievous

23:52.790 --> 23:53.680
and loves to fight.

23:54.000 --> 23:55.270
Whenever

23:55.270 --> 23:56.550
she gets into trouble outside,

23:56.680 --> 23:58.510
my parents always compare me to her,

23:58.880 --> 24:00.750
constantly speaking ill of her.

24:02.400 --> 24:03.110
But you're not

24:03.110 --> 24:04.440
much different from her.

24:06.240 --> 24:07.110
Compared to her,

24:07.550 --> 24:08.920
I'm still a bit better.

24:10.410 --> 24:11.350
Whenever my father

24:11.350 --> 24:12.440
scolded her,

24:13.270 --> 24:15.160
she would always find a way to take her frustration out on me.

24:15.350 --> 24:16.480
I was beaten by her

24:16.510 --> 24:18.240
since I was little.

24:18.240 --> 24:19.110
So, you just tolerated it?

24:19.110 --> 24:19.830
No.

24:20.750 --> 24:21.480
After I got up,

24:21.480 --> 24:22.790
I went to complain to my father.

24:23.110 --> 24:23.920
And then,

24:24.830 --> 24:26.030
I got beaten again.

24:34.110 --> 24:34.920
Tanyin,

24:36.440 --> 24:37.590
that day in Yandu,

24:37.990 --> 24:39.640
how did you save me?

24:42.590 --> 24:43.960
Just like that.

24:44.550 --> 24:45.350
Like what?

24:46.110 --> 24:47.240
I fought my way out.

24:50.640 --> 24:51.510
You've forgotten.

24:51.860 --> 24:53.340
I have a mechanical bird that can fly.

24:54.070 --> 24:55.680
No one can stop me.

24:56.640 --> 24:57.720
I remember,

24:58.590 --> 24:59.790
before I fainted,

25:00.270 --> 25:01.030
your mechanical bird

25:01.030 --> 25:02.550
had already been destroyed.

25:03.600 --> 25:06.070
It... It was destroyed after I saved you.

25:09.680 --> 25:10.480
Really?

25:16.160 --> 25:17.790
It's quite cold here at night.

25:17.830 --> 25:19.200
You're still injured.

25:19.300 --> 25:20.540
Let's go back first.

25:21.960 --> 25:22.600
Alright.

25:27.000 --> 25:27.790
Come on.

25:40.480 --> 25:41.350
You've forgotten.

25:41.680 --> 25:43.160
I have a mechanical bird that can fly.

25:43.640 --> 25:45.240
No one can stop me.

25:46.960 --> 25:48.000
Heaven and Earth are the primal source, from which all energies arise.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.350
Born of deep wisdom, all things return to their origin.

25:49.350 --> 25:50.510
Yandu, gather!

26:52.480 --> 26:54.640
How are you feeling? Better?

26:59.160 --> 27:00.030
Much better.

27:00.680 --> 27:01.720
After applying the medicine a few more times,

27:01.720 --> 27:02.310
your eyes

27:02.310 --> 27:03.680
will recover soon.

27:05.440 --> 27:06.510
I'll head back now.

27:07.110 --> 27:08.590
I woke up early this morning

27:08.590 --> 27:10.440
just to avoid Curly.

27:10.880 --> 27:11.830
Don't worry.

27:12.440 --> 27:14.070
Actually, Curly is even more timid.

27:14.590 --> 27:16.440
Her personality is a bit strange.

27:16.590 --> 27:17.750
Has she always been like this?

27:18.920 --> 27:19.790
I suppose so.

27:20.440 --> 27:21.240
Curly

27:21.920 --> 27:23.750
was born into a large family.

27:24.590 --> 27:26.030
We've known each other since childhood.

27:27.750 --> 27:29.680
While others could transform in about 10 years,

27:30.200 --> 27:31.070
it took her

27:31.590 --> 27:32.960
50 years.

27:33.680 --> 27:35.030
We all thought

27:35.160 --> 27:36.790
she wouldn't be able to transform at all.

27:37.160 --> 27:38.400
The Youhu Clan

27:38.400 --> 27:39.680
is generally laid-back in personality,

27:40.310 --> 27:42.880
with our fair share of bad habits,

27:44.000 --> 27:45.350
but Curly's habits

27:45.820 --> 27:46.820
seem even stranger.

27:47.720 --> 27:48.510
Reclusive?

28:02.640 --> 28:03.640
Yes, and her fur is different.

28:04.310 --> 28:05.960
While others have smooth, straight fur,

28:06.480 --> 28:07.270
hers

28:07.830 --> 28:08.750
is curly.

28:09.000 --> 28:09.920
Because of this,

28:10.680 --> 28:12.400
she's often the subject of ridicule.

28:12.680 --> 28:13.550
As for her,

28:14.240 --> 28:15.350
she couldn't fight back,

28:16.110 --> 28:17.240
always getting the short end of the stick.

28:17.310 --> 28:18.750
Over time,

28:18.790 --> 28:20.240
she developed the habit of avoiding people whenever possible.

28:20.720 --> 28:22.640
But her skill in barrier magic

28:22.640 --> 28:23.590
is impressive.

28:23.790 --> 28:25.480
She's the type who learned it all on her own, without a teacher.

28:25.750 --> 28:27.640
She often uses her barrier magic

28:27.830 --> 28:29.110
to hide herself away.

28:29.270 --> 28:31.110
The whole family will search for her for days,

28:31.180 --> 28:32.370
but she just won't come out.

28:47.200 --> 28:49.160
It might be because she's upset or angry.

28:49.720 --> 28:50.750
Sometimes that's true,

28:51.640 --> 28:52.640
but most of the time,

28:53.030 --> 28:54.070
it's simply because there are too many people,

28:55.030 --> 28:56.000
and she finds it annoying.

28:59.440 --> 29:00.590
I see.

29:00.960 --> 29:02.110
So after she transformed,

29:02.350 --> 29:03.640
she stopped talking.

29:04.510 --> 29:06.070
It wasn't until she got a pet

29:06.680 --> 29:08.030
that she gradually started to improve.

29:53.110 --> 29:55.350
Curly's life is very structured.

29:56.350 --> 29:57.160
Four,

29:57.270 --> 29:58.070
three,

29:58.510 --> 29:59.310
two,

29:59.780 --> 30:00.580
one.

30:13.550 --> 30:14.960
She doesn't want to learn

30:15.310 --> 30:16.350
the clan's methods of cultivation.

30:17.200 --> 30:18.960
While she excels at Barrier Spell,

30:19.000 --> 30:20.350
no one else in the clan can do it,

30:20.960 --> 30:22.240
which is why

30:22.270 --> 30:23.160
she relies on

30:23.160 --> 30:24.640
breathing techniques

30:24.920 --> 30:26.160
to absorb spiritual energy

30:26.160 --> 30:27.200
at noon.

30:35.110 --> 30:36.590
The midday sun holds the essence of fire,

30:36.780 --> 30:38.650
containing the sun's true flames.

30:39.720 --> 30:42.680
It's the purest, most potent energy, burning through everything.

30:43.240 --> 30:45.590
Especially at noon,

30:45.960 --> 30:47.920
when the sun is at its peak.

30:48.640 --> 30:50.270
If she continues

30:50.270 --> 30:51.750
to absorb its energy,

30:52.030 --> 30:52.830
she may eventually

30:53.790 --> 30:56.640
achieve enlightenment and become a god.

30:59.240 --> 31:00.850
How do you know all of this?

31:05.000 --> 31:06.550
I... My master taught me.

31:07.200 --> 31:09.510
You know, he's really powerful.

31:14.960 --> 31:15.750
Maybe.

31:16.720 --> 31:17.590
She always says

31:18.000 --> 31:19.750
the spiritual energy she absorbs at noon

31:20.110 --> 31:20.920
is the sweetest

31:21.790 --> 31:22.880
and the most comfortable.

31:26.290 --> 31:27.100
By the way,

31:27.550 --> 31:29.160
she wrote a letter to us.

31:29.920 --> 31:31.110
I can't read it.

31:31.750 --> 31:32.830
I'll read it to you.

31:36.920 --> 31:38.030
I'll wake up at 9 a.m.

31:38.270 --> 31:40.270
Before then, I'll be asleep,

31:40.830 --> 31:42.030
so please keep quiet.

31:42.830 --> 31:43.920
At 9 a.m. sharp,

31:44.090 --> 31:47.240
I'll wash up and come out to fetch water.

31:47.600 --> 31:48.430
At 9:30 a.m...

31:48.510 --> 31:49.240
Enough.

31:49.880 --> 31:52.030
I know her routine well.

31:54.750 --> 31:55.960
She's reminding us

31:55.960 --> 31:57.240
not to come out carelessly,

31:57.310 --> 31:58.960
to avoid running into her.

31:59.750 --> 32:01.240
She was the same

32:01.510 --> 32:02.680
back at Fangwai Mountain,

32:03.680 --> 32:05.200
but no one really paid attention to it.

32:05.880 --> 32:07.000
Still, you don't need to worry about her.

32:07.880 --> 32:08.880
That's not right.

32:10.030 --> 32:12.200
After all, we're at her place,

32:12.200 --> 32:12.750
and we should

32:12.750 --> 32:14.070
respect her rules.

32:14.160 --> 32:14.960
Besides,

32:15.000 --> 32:16.550
she mostly stays in her room

32:16.550 --> 32:17.720
and doesn't come out.

32:17.880 --> 32:18.750
Honestly,

32:19.240 --> 32:20.960
it's not an inconvenience at all.

32:21.680 --> 32:22.480
Alright.

32:24.720 --> 32:25.960
Is that the reason

32:26.110 --> 32:27.720
she left Fangwai Mountain?

32:30.790 --> 32:32.000
The situation back then

32:32.000 --> 32:33.400
was much more complicated.

32:34.750 --> 32:35.590
At the time,

32:36.070 --> 32:38.030
the War Demons and the Youhu Clan were already in conflict.

32:39.110 --> 32:41.240
Curly's father was a general in the War Division.

32:41.550 --> 32:43.270
Even though he knew about Curly's condition,

32:43.880 --> 32:44.720
he still forced her

32:44.720 --> 32:45.790
to join the battlefield.

32:46.270 --> 32:47.550
It wasn't due to a lack of soldiers,

32:48.000 --> 32:49.000
but because

32:49.200 --> 32:50.070
he wanted her to be an example

32:50.070 --> 32:51.200
for the clan.

32:52.480 --> 32:54.000
As you can imagine,

32:54.390 --> 32:56.980
Curly's condition only worsened.

32:57.550 --> 32:58.440
If I hadn't secretly

32:58.440 --> 32:59.590
rescued her,

33:00.270 --> 33:01.160
she might have

33:01.750 --> 33:03.550
already lost her sanity by now.

33:08.790 --> 33:10.550
I should have been more considerate toward her.

33:27.310 --> 33:28.720
Why aren't you following the rules?

33:28.830 --> 33:29.920
It's noon now,

33:29.920 --> 33:30.510
which means it's clearly my time

33:30.510 --> 33:31.830
to be out and about.

33:42.480 --> 33:43.350
How's it going?

33:44.960 --> 33:45.750
Look,

33:45.970 --> 33:47.250
the float is broken.

33:49.400 --> 33:50.830
It should be 1 p.m. now,

33:51.350 --> 33:52.510
not noon.

34:00.750 --> 34:01.920
I knew it.

34:02.110 --> 34:02.830
I've been feeling

34:02.830 --> 34:04.270
a bit off lately.

34:04.400 --> 34:06.270
I thought I was getting sick.

34:06.870 --> 34:07.630
Don't worry.

34:07.660 --> 34:09.070
I can fix it for you.

34:09.320 --> 34:10.110
You?

34:10.489 --> 34:11.230
Of course.

34:17.280 --> 34:18.110
It's all fixed.

34:19.739 --> 34:20.739
It's fixed?

34:21.510 --> 34:22.550
That was quick!

34:25.040 --> 34:25.929
Quick indeed.

34:26.510 --> 34:27.840
You're amazing!

34:30.960 --> 34:31.880
Here, take it.

34:34.670 --> 34:35.920
What's this?

34:35.920 --> 34:37.440
It's a bamboo dragonfly I made.

34:38.190 --> 34:39.710
Does it actually fly?

34:39.710 --> 34:40.760
Of course it does.

34:44.670 --> 34:46.000
What book are you reading?

34:49.159 --> 34:50.250
"Legend of Immortals."

34:50.670 --> 34:52.440
It tells the story of a remarkable woman

34:52.440 --> 34:54.630
who, on the fifteenth of July at 7 a.m.,

34:54.630 --> 34:56.480
with purple clouds swirling in the sky,

34:56.719 --> 34:57.840
flags and banners waving,

34:58.150 --> 34:59.030
and everyone watching,

34:59.030 --> 35:00.110
saw her soar towards the heavens,

35:00.110 --> 35:01.320
rising higher and higher,

35:01.400 --> 35:02.920
until she entered the Divine Realm

35:02.960 --> 35:04.880
and became a god.

35:05.590 --> 35:06.670
But this is just a fictional tale,

35:06.670 --> 35:08.000
dreamed up by someone.

35:08.110 --> 35:09.440
It shouldn't be taken literally.

35:10.150 --> 35:11.800
Why can't it be true?

35:11.800 --> 35:12.670
It clearly describes

35:12.670 --> 35:14.710
how she ascended

35:14.710 --> 35:15.760
to become a god.

35:16.190 --> 35:17.630
The Divine Realm is not in the sky,

35:17.840 --> 35:19.110
and the difference between the Divine Realm and the Mortal Realm

35:19.230 --> 35:20.800
is not a matter of distance,

35:21.070 --> 35:22.510
but of entirely separate worlds.

35:24.670 --> 35:26.320
Have you heard of the Heavenly Ladder?

35:29.670 --> 35:30.760
In the past, the Heavenly Ladder

35:30.760 --> 35:32.320
was the passage between the two realms.

35:33.510 --> 35:34.840
But now, the passage has been destroyed,

35:35.110 --> 35:37.630
and the two worlds can no longer connect.

35:38.590 --> 35:40.440
To travel from one realm to the other,

35:40.670 --> 35:42.670
you must cross the Sea of Flux.

35:43.550 --> 35:45.360
What is the Sea of Flux?

35:45.590 --> 35:47.400
I've never heard of it before.

35:48.280 --> 35:49.710
You can think of the Sea of Flux

35:49.710 --> 35:50.710
as a barrier,

35:51.590 --> 35:53.480
a wall that separates the heavens from the humans.

35:56.070 --> 35:57.000
So,

35:57.110 --> 35:58.710
if I can find a way

35:58.710 --> 35:59.760
to cross that wall,

35:59.880 --> 36:01.070
I can reach the Divine Realm

36:01.070 --> 36:02.000
and become a god?

36:02.000 --> 36:03.440
Theoretically, yes.

36:04.230 --> 36:06.320
But you shouldn't think about it.

36:06.880 --> 36:08.230
It's incredibly dangerous.

36:09.070 --> 36:10.280
Even gods,

36:10.550 --> 36:12.110
attempting to cross the Sea of Flux,

36:12.670 --> 36:14.320
face a life-or-death struggle.

36:14.510 --> 36:15.430
Why?

36:17.150 --> 36:18.550
Because it's a realm beyond the world,

36:19.510 --> 36:21.360
untethered by the laws of heaven and earth.

36:22.430 --> 36:24.200
How do you know so much about it?

36:33.880 --> 36:34.960
Can you see it now?

36:38.550 --> 36:39.360
Is it better?

36:42.320 --> 36:43.190
How does it feel?

36:43.590 --> 36:44.440
Are you alright?

36:48.880 --> 36:49.710
It's fine,

36:50.230 --> 36:51.510
just a little sting.

36:52.000 --> 36:52.960
I've just applied the medicine.

36:53.710 --> 36:54.960
It'll feel better in a couple of days.

36:55.920 --> 36:57.800
Today, I checked your wound.

36:58.760 --> 36:59.920
The others are healing well,

37:00.800 --> 37:02.280
but the knife wound on your chest

37:02.280 --> 37:03.400
hasn't fully healed yet.

37:04.760 --> 37:06.440
I heard from Qian Lin about that knife.

37:06.840 --> 37:07.670
It's called

37:07.840 --> 37:09.230
the God-Slaying Dagger,

37:09.360 --> 37:10.510
and it's quite sinister.

37:11.000 --> 37:12.510
You need to take extra care of yourself.

37:14.320 --> 37:15.320
Don't worry,

37:16.000 --> 37:17.760
I have the Divine Left Hand.

37:18.160 --> 37:20.330
I can heal any injury.

37:23.030 --> 37:24.630
I'll go prepare the medicine for you now.

37:27.070 --> 37:28.030
Thank you.

37:28.670 --> 37:30.000
If it hadn't been for you,

37:31.230 --> 37:32.000
I honestly don't know

37:32.000 --> 37:33.070
what I would have done.

37:34.510 --> 37:36.030
You're saying this all of a sudden.

37:36.190 --> 37:37.760
I'm not quite used to it.

37:39.360 --> 37:40.710
What's so strange about it?

37:41.360 --> 37:42.670
I'm simply telling the truth.

37:44.400 --> 37:45.480
I'll go prepare the medicine now.

38:23.370 --> 38:24.520
Can you still hold on?

38:26.760 --> 38:28.510
Where is Taihe's body?

38:28.760 --> 38:30.240
Didn't you see it?

38:30.260 --> 38:31.860
That was just an illusion from the Luofu Sea.

38:31.920 --> 38:33.190
It wasn't Taihe at all.

38:33.190 --> 38:34.920
Where exactly is Taihe?

38:37.840 --> 38:39.400
Did you scheme against Tanyin,

38:39.400 --> 38:40.760
causing her to lose her divine bone?

38:40.760 --> 38:41.510
Shut up!

38:42.300 --> 38:43.490
Don't mention her to me.

38:44.000 --> 38:45.250
That good-for-nothing,

38:45.710 --> 38:46.880
worthless girl,

38:47.700 --> 38:49.260
for the sake of some man,

38:49.670 --> 38:51.280
she not only abandoned Taihe,

38:51.640 --> 38:53.120
but also neglected herself.

38:53.670 --> 38:54.480
Tell me,

38:54.480 --> 38:55.710
why has this happened?

38:56.110 --> 38:57.510
She has practiced for so many years,

38:57.510 --> 38:58.760
with such great talent.

38:58.760 --> 38:59.880
She could have focused on her cultivation,

38:59.880 --> 39:00.710
made further progress,

39:00.710 --> 39:01.230
and lived a peaceful life,

39:01.230 --> 39:02.880
doing what she loves,

39:02.880 --> 39:04.480
enjoying longevity with the heavens, earth, and sun.

39:04.480 --> 39:05.510
But instead,

39:05.630 --> 39:06.590
she chose to become

39:06.590 --> 39:08.280
a despised mouse,

39:08.280 --> 39:09.480
chased by others,

39:09.480 --> 39:10.800
burned in blazing flames,

39:10.800 --> 39:12.590
hated by all!

39:15.030 --> 39:16.280
If you truly care for her,

39:16.590 --> 39:18.320
why did you hurt her?

39:18.320 --> 39:19.150
It's not me!

39:19.150 --> 39:20.150
I didn't hurt her!

39:20.150 --> 39:21.230
It's her fault!

39:25.150 --> 39:26.590
She's always been like this.

39:27.920 --> 39:28.710
No,

39:30.110 --> 39:31.510
I should have realized it earlier.

39:33.280 --> 39:35.280
What are you trying to say?

39:37.630 --> 39:39.400
They're all the same.

39:39.880 --> 39:41.630
She can't remember

39:41.630 --> 39:44.190
how I worked day and night for her.

39:44.280 --> 39:45.960
How

39:45.960 --> 39:47.840
I nearly

39:47.860 --> 39:49.460
exhausted myself

39:49.770 --> 39:52.400
to make her live a comfortable life,

39:52.430 --> 39:54.400
so she could smile.

39:54.930 --> 39:56.860
She only remembers those men,

39:56.890 --> 39:58.290
their few words,

39:58.310 --> 40:00.150
their empty promises,

40:00.550 --> 40:02.480
and their appearances,

40:02.480 --> 40:03.880
which,

40:03.880 --> 40:04.880
in the blink of an eye,

40:04.880 --> 40:06.440
were destroyed.

40:06.840 --> 40:08.280
In the end,

40:08.280 --> 40:09.960
they brought themselves to this pitiful state.

40:10.760 --> 40:12.480
They should regret it.

40:12.920 --> 40:14.360
They should all die!

40:16.280 --> 40:17.070
Hannv,

40:17.920 --> 40:20.190
Tanyin and Chu aren't the same person.

40:20.800 --> 40:22.400
They're all the same!

40:22.590 --> 40:23.590
They're all fools

40:23.590 --> 40:24.840
who only get deceived by men!

40:26.800 --> 40:28.760
What do you want to do?

40:29.150 --> 40:30.960
Where exactly is Taihe?

40:30.960 --> 40:33.030
What do you want to do?

40:52.690 --> 40:54.040
Don't rush.

40:57.670 --> 40:59.550
You'll find out soon.

41:00.510 --> 41:01.320
Everything

41:02.170 --> 41:03.850
will end soon.

41:12.550 --> 41:13.360
Hannv!

41:14.320 --> 41:15.240
Hannv!

41:24.510 --> 41:25.880
The medicine today is very bitter.

41:26.030 --> 41:27.190
I made a soup.

41:27.480 --> 41:28.440
Try it.

41:44.110 --> 41:45.360
It's a mix of sour and sweet,

41:45.920 --> 41:47.030
with a hint

41:47.440 --> 41:48.840
of fresh floral fragrance.

41:50.190 --> 41:51.710
That's the pear tree flower.

41:58.370 --> 41:59.210
It's delicious.

42:04.660 --> 42:06.700
Actually, the Fragrant Grove is quite nice.

42:05.740 --> 42:07.020
♫Listening♫

42:07.050 --> 42:10.550
♫Toona leaves knock fireflies into a vase♫

42:07.400 --> 42:08.150
It's much better than

42:08.150 --> 42:09.880
any place I found in Yandu.

42:10.280 --> 42:12.150
It's perfect for a family to live together.

42:10.570 --> 42:13.530
♫Ripples faintly spreading♫

42:13.480 --> 42:14.670
Do you like it here?

42:14.440 --> 42:15.800
♫In the pavilion in the clouds♫

42:15.360 --> 42:16.150
Yes, I like it.

42:15.820 --> 42:17.780
♫Warm wine brews to the sound of the zither♫

42:17.980 --> 42:22.450
♫The fragrance lingers like brush strokes, sketching out your form♫

42:19.630 --> 42:20.440
Now,

42:21.590 --> 42:23.000
it should be dusk, right?

42:23.170 --> 42:24.330
♫Tonight♫

42:24.500 --> 42:28.350
♫In a light intoxication, I feel the longing in the crystalline snow♫

42:24.550 --> 42:25.800
It's already night.

42:28.030 --> 42:28.840
Are there

42:28.380 --> 42:31.230
♫I cannot bear to think of you♫

42:30.320 --> 42:31.630
stars in the sky?

42:31.620 --> 42:33.250
♫I only wish♫

42:33.280 --> 42:35.110
♫That the years would remain ever sunny♫

42:35.520 --> 42:39.690
♫So that, within the drifting light, I could share the breeze with you♫

42:36.670 --> 42:38.630
Yes, many of them.

42:39.230 --> 42:40.150
They're beautiful.

42:40.300 --> 42:41.270
♫The wind blows♫

42:41.290 --> 42:42.690
♫It stirs the scenery♫

42:42.900 --> 42:44.440
♫It awakens our heart♫

42:44.460 --> 42:48.110
♫It makes me certain that you are my destiny♫

42:47.710 --> 42:49.630
Your eye injury is only temporary.

42:48.730 --> 42:49.980
♫The closer we get♫

42:50.000 --> 42:51.610
♫The more it feels like a dream♫

42:51.630 --> 42:53.000
♫And the more I look intoxicated♫

42:53.020 --> 42:57.340
♫I cannot fully express my yearning for you♫

42:54.150 --> 42:55.960
When I was at Tianqu Peak,

42:56.800 --> 42:57.670
whenever I looked up,

42:57.480 --> 42:58.470
♫The wind blows♫

42:58.500 --> 43:00.260
♫It blows away the shadows of the clouds♫

42:59.630 --> 43:00.840
I could only see a tiny patch of sky,

43:00.300 --> 43:01.950
♫It makes the moon seem even brighter♫

43:01.230 --> 43:02.630
no bigger than the size of my palm.

43:01.980 --> 43:06.160
♫It makes me wake up from a dream♫

43:04.150 --> 43:05.630
I used to think that

43:06.180 --> 43:07.410
♫The wind blows♫

43:06.480 --> 43:07.670
once I was free,

43:07.430 --> 43:09.030
♫It reddens my eyes♫

43:08.480 --> 43:10.400
I'd finally be able to truly gaze at the stars.

43:09.050 --> 43:11.050
♫It warms the promise we made♫

43:11.160 --> 43:14.690
♫In the wind, we gently♫

43:12.630 --> 43:13.480
But who would have thought

43:14.510 --> 43:15.960
it would take forty years for me to escape?

43:14.710 --> 43:17.400
♫Drift into a better place♫

43:17.630 --> 43:19.000
By the time I did,

43:20.280 --> 43:21.030
I had already lost the desire

43:21.030 --> 43:22.630
to admire the stars.
